        {
            "title": "Call of Duty: Black Ops 6 (PC) Review",
            "date": "2024-11-05 06:00:00",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/CGMagazine/6146943657174073371",
            "content": "<img src=\"https://www.cgmagonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/call-of-duty-black-ops-6-pc-review-2024-11-05-060143.jpg\" alt=\"Call of Duty: Black Ops 6 (PC) Review\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" /> \n<p><em>Call of Duty: Black Ops 6</em> is the twenty-fourth installment in the long-running and yearly franchise, and it sets itself apart as a standout entry. After a few recent titles that didn’t quite hit the mark, <em>Call of Duty: Black Ops 6</em> breathes new life into the franchise with a captivating campaign, a thrilling zombie mode, and a fresh multiplayer experience. <a href=\"https://www.cgmagonline.com/articles/features/5-reasons-black-ops-6-mp/\"><em>Black Ops 6</em> respects</a> <em>COD</em>‘s legacy while pushing boundaries, making it a must-play for both long-time fans and newcomers.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The campaign is one of the strongest stories we’ve experienced in the series recently. It revolves around two rogue operatives, Troy Marshall and Frank Woods, who find themselves at the helm of a covert operation. Their mission this time is to assemble a team of skilled agents to take down Pantheon, a mysterious paramilitary organization that plans a false flag attack on American soil that could undermine the government and discredit the Deputy Director of the CIA. </p>\n\n\n\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https://www.cgmagonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/call-of-duty-black-ops-6-pc-review-2024-11-05-968106.jpg\" alt=\"Call of Duty: Black Ops 6 (PC) Review\" class=\"wp-image-1094345\" title=\"Call of Duty: Black Ops 6 (PC) Review\" srcset=\"https://www.cgmagonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/call-of-duty-black-ops-6-pc-review-2024-11-05-968106.jpg 1920w, https://www.cgmagonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/call-of-duty-black-ops-6-pc-review-2024-11-05-968106-300x169.jpg 300w, https://www.cgmagonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/call-of-duty-black-ops-6-pc-review-2024-11-05-968106-768x432.jpg 768w, https://www.cgmagonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/call-of-duty-black-ops-6-pc-review-2024-11-05-968106-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://www.cgmagonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/call-of-duty-black-ops-6-pc-review-2024-11-05-968106-565x318.jpg 565w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />\n\n\n<p>Marshall and Woods must navigate... <a href=\"https://www.cgmagonline.com/review/game/call-of-duty-black-ops-6-pc-review/\">Read more</a></p></img></img>"
        },
